    <values><field>LongDescription__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Finds: Open renewal opportunities whose close date is past the originating contract&apos;s end date.
Why it matters: The renewal is slipping — the contract has ended and there&apos;s still no closed deal. Risk of customer churn or revenue gap between contract end and renewal start.
Suppress a finding: when a customer-confirmed renewal extension is in flight.
Disable the detector: only if renewal pipeline lives outside Opportunity. Most should leave this on.</value></values>
